  "body": " Modifying a Matrix       Operation  Syntax  Effect    Change one element  A(i, j) = newval  Replaces the value at row i , column j .    Replace a row  A(i, :) = rowvec  Replaces row i with a new row vector (or scalar).    Replace a column  A(:, j) = colvec  Replaces column j with a new column vector (or scalar).    Replace a block  A(rows, cols) = B  Replaces a rectangular region with a matrix of matching shape (or a scalar).    Delete a row  A(i, :) = []  Removes row i ; later rows shift up.    Delete a column  A(:, j) = []  Removes column j ; later columns shift left.    "
